com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-302303 shisihangshi.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/26/Spine_static-302303_shisihangshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"176\" height=\"496\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"176\" data-file-height=\"496\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg orange.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_orange.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_orange.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_orange.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_orange.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/dc/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_orange.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">全新神秘术特效</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg purple.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_purple.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_purple.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_purple.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_purple.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/de/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_purple.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">全新Live2D交互动作</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3023\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%97\" title=\"十四行诗\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%97\" title=\"十四行诗\"><img alt=\"十四行诗\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%97\" title=\"十四行诗\">十四行诗</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.0</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>橄榄枝战线</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：302303</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">你再也不会见到比她更优秀的学员了。巡礼队列的最前端，她理应站在这样的位置。三个月前的第一次排练，她便站得如今天一样笔挺，连同她身上的点缀物——礼帽、手套和绶带，也从未出现一丝褶皱。<br />她将手杖举至胸前，她将这视为责任，而非荣光。因为她很清楚，在毕业仪式中，她只是一份彰显政绩的“点缀物”。她代表着规范化培训的胜利，亦是基金会的优秀武力储备。<br />乐声响起，白鸽飞向晴空——她踩着节拍，走进这个肃穆的纯白殿堂。 这场仪式标志着她将走入外面的世界。她抬头望去，在广阔的蓝天下，有的只是……有些刺眼的艳阳。<br />这一切如此新鲜，如此陌生，触动了那颗镌刻着“忠诚”的心脏。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"302303\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302304.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a7/Belonging-302304.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">巡礼制服帽<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Parade Uniform Beret</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>第一防线学校为巡礼日特制的礼帽，在贝雷帽的基础上改制。铜管记录了关于传统、荣耀、理性、责任的赞美诗篇。<br />一个人性化的神秘术，让它兼备了提词器的功能——尽管受访者并不需要这点。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302305.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/57/Belonging-302305.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">巡礼长缎手套<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Parade Satin Gloves</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>第一防线学校为巡礼日特制的手套。经过了细心的漂染和浆洗，每个褶皱都被十四行诗仔细熨平。为了仪式的完美无瑕，她需要付出这样的时间代价。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302306.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/20/Belonging-302306.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">仪典手杖<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Ceremony Stick</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>第一防线学校单独授予十四行诗的巡礼手杖，作为给最优秀毕业生的荣耀勋章。她将持它立于队列之首，一如既往。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%A1%E7%A4%BC%E9%A2%821.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 巡礼颂1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%A1%E7%A4%BC%E9%A2%821.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%A1%E7%A4%BC%E9%A2%821.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%A1%E7%A4%BC%E9%A2%821.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%A1%E7%A4%BC%E9%A2%821.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%A1%E7%A4%BC%E9%A2%821.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%A1%E7%A4%BC%E9%A2%821.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%A1%E7%A4%BC%E9%A2%822.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 巡礼颂2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%A1%E7%A4%BC%E9%A2%822.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%A1%E7%A4%BC%E9%A2%822.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%A1%E7%A4%BC%E9%A2%822.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%A1%E7%A4%BC%E9%A2%822.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%A1%E7%A4%BC%E9%A2%822.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%B7%A1%E7%A4%BC%E9%A2%822.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">巡礼颂 <small style=\"color: grey\">Parade Anthem</small></span></span>"}}